{"id": "34526", "title": "皇冠上的蜻蜓", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 45, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34526.htm", "intro": "这披头散发、仪容不整的小菜鸟,就是设计公司派来跟他谈生意的代表？那还有什么好谈的,拒绝！而她竟再次登门拜访,还意外的说服他,成为她设计生涯的第一个客人,可这叫「蜻蜓」的怪妹,竟喊他大叔,还有个对食物毫无抵抗力的怪癖,不但有吃必嗑,还动他心爱马儿的主意,原因竟是家里食指浩繁常吃不饱,她阿信般的身世,让他下意识的对她好,连她像串粽子般多的弟妹,都一视同仁,宠着宠着,竟有将她收在羽翼下的冲动,可那笨女人却依然食物第一、家人第二,而他根本不知道排在地球哪个角落呢……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34526", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2190406.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2190407.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2190408.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2190409.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2190410.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2190411.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2190412.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2190413.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2190414.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2190415.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2190416.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2190417.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2190418.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2190419.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2190420.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2190421.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2190422.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2190423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2190424.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2190425.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2190426.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2190427.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2190428.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2190429.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file":